@startuml
title SwapCampus Core Subgraph: Marketplace

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam ArrowColor #4B5563
skinparam packageBorderColor #6B7280
skinparam classBorderColor #6B7280
skinparam noteBorderColor #9CA3AF
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam ranksep 110
skinparam nodesep 80

hide methods
top to bottom direction

class "User" as User {
  +id
  +name
  +credit
}

class "Product" as Product {
  +id
  +title
  +price
  +status
}

class "Product Image" as ProductImage {
  +image
}

class "Order" as Order {
  +id
  +status
  +location
}

class "Review" as Review {
  +id
  +rating
}

class "Appeal" as Appeal {
  +id
  +reason
  +status
}

User -[hidden]down- Product
Product -[hidden]down- Order
Order -[hidden]down- Review
Review -[hidden]down- Appeal
Product -[hidden]right- ProductImage

User "1" -down- "0..*" Product : publishes
Product "1" -down- "0..*" Order : creates
User "1" -[norank]right- "0..*" Order : buyer / seller
Product "1" -right- "1..*" ProductImage : has
Order "1" -down- "0..*" Review : produces
Order "1" -down- "0..*" Appeal : produces

note bottom of User
Favorites and other
supporting entities
are omitted here.
end note

note right of Order
An order connects
the product and users.
The same user can act
as buyer or seller.
Reviews and appeals
are attached to orders.
end note

@enduml
